Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.999 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  every day you get a chance to be alive  and every day you get this chance you  should attempt to make the most of what  you do with it so as the light takes its  temporary intermission and you prepare  to drift away into the dream state of  your mind take a moment to consciously  reflect ask yourself what did i do today  am I happy with what I did  should I have done more should I have  done less could I have done what I did  differently to make it more enjoyable  more beautiful more engaging think about  whether or not you let yourself fully  engage in the beauty of this life ask  yourself did I add beauty or take it  away then ask what can I do tomorrow to  make and add a little more beauty  [Music]  sit with these questions for a little  while let them hang in your head  [Music]  now let them go except that the day is  now over and regardless of how good or  bad it may have seemed let it go and  give yourself the credit you deserve the  credit for caring about your life for  wanting to ask these questions the  credit for surviving a full day on this  planet in this uncertain reality the  fact that you can even understand what  life and beauty is that you can even ask  these questions all justifies your  worthiness of acquiring their best  answers worthiness of feeling success  bliss and gratitude in your life so  before you completely relinquish the  remaining pieces of your awareness to  the night take one last moment to  remember to thank the wonder that is  your life take a moment to be thankful  for the people that you have encountered  today the things you experienced and the  concepts you learned and finally be  thankful that you can close your eyes  and go to sleep  knowing that tomorrow you will wake up  alongside the Sun and get another chance  to write more of your story  you  [Music]

